        <mxCell id="P3Vi-YAWHYYvR9TPbQ4V-37" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;Overview&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;div&gt;The arrows denote the flow of information.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;The Server &#39;serves&#39; the pages&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;The Collector connects to the server to open the websocket connection.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;The Collector started as only listening for event on the websocket, but now also sender commands back to the server, so maybe we should rename it &#39;Connection&#39; ?&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
